# Check text files out with LF on every platform, so that Prettier (which
# enforces LF), git, and CI all agree on the contents of a file. Without this, a
# Windows checkout gets CRLF and `npm run prettier` reports the whole repository
# as unformatted even though nothing in it differs from HEAD.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Images and archives are never line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.cbz binary
*.cbr binary
*.7z binary
*.jar binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
